{
  "id": "phy6-c5-s9",
  "card_id": "phy6-c5-s9",
  "chapter": "功和功率、能量",
  "section": null,
  "number": "76",
  "title": "机械效率",
  "printed_title": "76. 机械效率",
  "start_page": 203,
  "start_printed": 192,
  "figures": [],
  "exercise_count": 4,
  "prose": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "在我们研究杠杆的结构和作用原理时，我们没有考虑摩擦以及杠杆本身的重量. 在这种理想的条件下，加在杠杆上的动力所做的功（我们把这个功叫做**总功**）等于提升重物或克服某种阻力所做的**有用功**.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "而实际上，**使用机械时所做的总功总是多于有用功**，因为有一部分功要用于克服机械中的摩擦阻力及使机械的一些部件发生移动.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "例如，使用动滑轮提升重物时，不得不为了提高滑轮本身和绳子以及克服滑轮轴处的摩擦而做一部分附加的功.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "不管我们使用的是什么机械，做的有用功都只是总功的一部分. 因此，若用字母$A_{\\text{有用}}$表示有用功，用$A$表示总功，则可写成",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$A_{\\text{有用}}<A$, 或$\\frac{A_{\\text{有用}}}{A}<1$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**有用功与总功的比值称为机械效率**，用符号$K$表示，即有",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$K=\\frac{A_{\\text{有用}}}{A}$.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "通常都将机械效率表示成百分数的形式，即",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**$K=\\frac{A_{\\text{有用}}}{A}\\times100\\%$.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 192,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0203#11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**例题.** 在杠杆的短臂上挂一个质量为100千克的重物.为提升此重物而在长臂上施加一个250牛顿的力. 若重物被提升的高度为$h_1=0.08$米，而动力的作用点下降的高度为$h_2=0.4$米，试求此杠杆的机械效率.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**解：**重物的重量$P=gm$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#2"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$P=9.8$牛顿/千克$\\times100$千克$\\approx1000$牛顿. 有用功$A_{\\text{有用}}=Ph_1$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#3"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$A_{\\text{有用}}=1000$牛顿$\\times0.08$米$=80$焦耳.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#4"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "总功$A=Fh_2$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$A=250$牛顿$\\times0.4$米$=100$焦耳.",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#6"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "机械效率$K=\\frac{A_{\\text{有用}}}{A}\\times100\\%$，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#7"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "**$K=\\frac{80\\text{焦耳}}{100\\text{焦耳}}\\times100\\%=80\\%$.**",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 193,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0204#8"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
